{"capability_report":{"encoding":"verislop.formalizer-capability-gap/0.1","gaps":[{"attempted_representations":["Encode requirement IDs, kinds, roles, required flags, source properties, stage names and trusted components in monomorphic records and lists, then check them with list operations and scalar formulas. This expresses stipulated data but provides no primitive connecting that data to the actual reconstructed contract, independent checking events or configured trust boundary. Equality of such constants cannot establish O8.","Represent the functional aggregation with sorted unique group strings, exact ceiling-derived bucket ranges, occurrence-preserving filters, integer sums and total folds carrying optional previous sums and ordered output records. Mixed source/value rows can preserve O1 through O7 and their universal functional propositions; source-only rows can preserve I1 and S1. These constructions supply no predicate for O8's actual contract metadata or verification workflow.","Use the raw Lean alternative for workflow statements. It remains subject to the same executable DSL acceptance gates and introduces no registered predicate binding actual contract reconstruction, staged checks or trust configuration. Replacing O8 with a source contract, True, reflexive equality or an aggregation theorem would omit required behavior."],"feature":"Registered predicate binding actual reconstructed contract metadata, staged independent checks and configured trust boundary","obligation_ids":["O8"],"reason":"O8 requires facts about the actual proposed and kernel-reconstructed contracts: retained IDs, kinds, roles and required flags; exact source and complete value facets; independent checking before proof, after acceptance and at closure; and the configured Tier 2 restricted_source vscore/0.3 trust boundary. No provided term, formula or source-requirement constructor refers to those actual artifacts, checking stages or configuration. O8 permits no assumptions. A faithful complete contract therefore remains unavailable in the registered language; this report establishes neither impossibility nor acceptance nor source discharge."}],"obligation_ids":["D1","A1","O1","O2","O3","O4","O5","O6","O7","O8","I1","S1","N1"]}}